    "description": "<p>You strike a creature with a spear formed of burning and draining aether, draining away its energy to replenish yourself.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It takes <strong>1 Damage</strong>, which ignores <strong>Armor</strong>,<strong> </strong>and you regain the same amount of <strong>Stamina</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, you gain <strong>+1 bonus dice</strong> on the next casting check you make before the end of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>bonus dice</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase both the <strong>Damag</strong>e dealt and the <strong>Stamina</strong> regained by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.EuMjCYrnWEhRW8qF]{The Penumbral Spear}</p>",
